+            @Comment("ZSTD compression level for Linear files (1-22). Default 6. Out-of-range values log SEVERE and fall back to 6. NOTE: Kaiiju's message said 1-22 but its check was `> 23`; the correct max is 22 (zstd-jni 1.5.4-1).")
